<title>USA: CNA Financial issues $250 mln 10-year debt.</title>
<headline>CNA Financial issues $250 mln 10-year debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following investment grade debt issue from CNA Financial Corp was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CNA FINANCIAL</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.665  FIRST PAY DATE 5/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 6.797 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 63 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES: PRICED OVER 10-YEAR U.S. T-NOTE U.S. corporate bond unit 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
